            <ArticleTitle>Coronary artery steal: demonstration by digital coronary radiography.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>61-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors, using a new digital coronary radiographic technique, report the demonstration of contrast-material-induced coronary artery steal. Attempts to measure myocardial blood flow using arteriographic techniques in the setting of complex coronary anatomy can be complicated by heterogeneous flow patterns.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
